Preserve observations versus gates, probability versus coverage, installed\nversus usable capacity, reserve versus flow, median versus percentile, hours\nversus days, source-local authority, and current versus stale evidence.\n\nChecks are candidate-bound mechanical feedback. They do not independently\nauthorize operations, readiness, submission, or closure.\n\n\nEXACT NEWLY EXTERNALIZED RESULTS\n--- NEWLY EXTERNALIZED RESULT-003 ---\n{\"object_id\":\"batch:GRID:1-60+WATER:1-60\",\"object_version\":\"d1ecb3814186f1a6327e7fa1b8a7befd76b1617b06163bb6a426511c6e355be8\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-003\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-batch-observation-v0\",\"segments\":[{\"end_line\":60,\"source_id\":\"GRID\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":60,\"source_id\":\"WATER\",\"start_line\":1}],\"total_source_bytes\":7344}\n--- exact batch segment 1 ---\n{\"end_line\":60,\"source_id\":\"GRID\",\"source_path\":\"sources/GRID_COOLING_POWER.md\",\"source_sha256\":\"2149dcb753ebd817f10869d394e30f61e89ac46d6d4de2ace9bde1cb7c13299d\",\"source_size_bytes\":5546,\"start_line\":1}\n--- exact source range ---\n# Cooling power, feeder limits, and backup capacity\n\n## Frozen findings\n\nInstalled cooling-service capacity is 31.0 megawatts, while current usable capacity after feeder derating is 24.5 megawatts. Installed and usable capacity must not be added or swapped.\nFeeder voltage is 12.6 kilovolts and must remain between 12.2 and 12.9 kilovolts at every critical node for three consecutive fifteen-minute windows. A system average cannot replace every-node compliance.\nBackup generation supplies 8.4 megawatts for sixteen hours at emergency cooling load, but only nine hours at full public load. The load regimes and durations remain distinct.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nSHELTER occupancy and CLINIC surge demand depend on GRID; SUPPLY controls fuel duration and WATER depends on powered pumps.\nA feeder, transformer, relay, fuel stock, or facility-load change makes earlier power evidence stale.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| GRD-000 | feeder-east | v3 | 28.0 | megawatts | superseded |\n| GRD-001 | feeder-west | v3 | 29.7 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-002 | library-hub | v3 | 28.5 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-003 | backup-plant | v3 | 30.2 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-004 | feeder-east | v3 | 29.0 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-005 | feeder-west | v3 | 30.7 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-006 | library-hub | v3 | 29.5 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-007 | backup-plant | v3 | 28.3 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-008 | feeder-east | v3 | 30.0 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-009 | feeder-west | v3 | 28.8 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-010 | library-hub | v3 | 30.5 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-011 | backup-plant | v3 | 29.3 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-012 | feeder-east | v3 | 28.1 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-013 | feeder-west | v4 | 29.8 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-014 | library-hub | v4 | 28.6 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-015 | backup-plant | v4 | 30.3 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-016 | feeder-east | v4 | 29.1 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-017 | feeder-west | v4 | 30.8 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-018 | library-hub | v4 | 29.6 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-019 | backup-plant | v4 | 28.4 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-020 | feeder-east | v4 | 30.1 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-021 | feeder-west | v4 | 28.9 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-022 | library-hub | v4 | 30.6 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-023 | backup-plant | v4 | 29.4 | megawatts | superseded |\n| GRD-024 | feeder-east | v4 | 28.2 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-025 | feeder-west | v4 | 29.9 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-026 | library-hub | v5 | 28.7 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-027 | backup-plant | v5 | 30.4 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-028 | feeder-east | v5 | 29.2 | megawatts | curr